n lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\">애로기술들을 학생들의 창의적인 아이디어로 교수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\">기업체가 공동으로 문제해결 및 시제품 제작을 통해 창의역량 및 실무능력 향상</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; text-indent: -26.3pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;\">우수한 문제해결 과제에 대하여 공동 특허출원 및 기술이전을 통해 지식재산권 역량 제고</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">개 요</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">신청서 접수 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">: 2020. 09. 08(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">) ~ 09.15(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(216, 15, 15); font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 300;\">추진 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2020. 09. 28 ~ 2020. 12. 31<b>(3</b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 300;\"><b>개월</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">참가 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-te