 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; </span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">세부 내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">구&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;성 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">기업체 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(3~5</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) + </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">지도교수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움